{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a journey through beautifully hand-drawn worlds in this turn-based puzzle adventure. Play as Sophia, a brave girl guided by a mysterious glowing pendant as she explores lands inspired by ancient Greek mythology in search of her lost father and her own inner courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/297b0211285688ddf0de6d05758386d2.poster.avif?t=1771195510\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/297b0211285688ddf0de6d05758386d2.webm?t=1771195510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/297b0211285688ddf0de6d05758386d2.mp4?t=1771195510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/86c73ac1226ac7f7eee51eef76911dfb.avif?t=1771195510\" width=1560 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to overcome a variety of obstacles as you traverse beautifully hand-drawn worlds ruled by powerful deities like Medusa, Zeus, and Hades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each realm presents unique challenges. In <strong>Medusa\u2019s Lair</strong> carefully navigate her gaze. Face <strong>Zeus\u2019s electrifying trials</strong> in the Sky Sanctuary and explore Hades\u2019 underworld by blending in among spirits or even help <strong>Goddess Hera</strong> with her runaway peacock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 