3197650/extras/bdedc18bc6e0589e323153d194f3425e.avif?t=1771195510\" width=1560 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down curious Little Rascals and collect ancient Relics hidden throughout each world. Exploration and curiosity are always rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/80b8121d902035a81159deca52691394.poster.avif?t=1771195510\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/80b8121d902035a81159deca52691394.webm?t=1771195510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197650/extras/80b8121d902035a81159deca52691394.mp4?t=1771195510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo now available!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first chapter of Sophia's adventure</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Ancient Greek village of <strong>Soteris</strong> and the <strong>Wanderwoods</strong>, leading toward Athena's temple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>friends</strong> who will help guide your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mischievous <strong>Rascals</strong> and long lost\u00a0<strong>Relics</strong> along each path </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support and playable on Steam Deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 challenging and mythologically inspired turn-based path puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four more beautifully hand-drawn worlds inspired by Greek m